### 1. Get All OfflineCPA Transactions (Local Ledger)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Upload Offline Receipt to Local User-Assets
# Note: You can also use Postman natively importing this file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dummy_upload.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Date,Description,Amount
2025-01-01,Test Offline Sync,100.00
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### 3. Export 1120-S Book to Offline Spreadsheet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/export
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
